  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Titukulane</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">FFP is funding a multi-year development activity implemented by a USAID Implementing Partner and aimed at supporting the implementation of Malawis National Resilience Strategy. The activity will focus on improving household income; fortifying maternal, child, and adolescent nutrition and health; and strengthening communities ability to recover from climatic shocks. In addition, the activity will work on strengthening institutional capacity of local actors, at the district and national level, to coordinate resilience investments as well as adopt effective approaches to prevent, mitigate, and respond to shocks.</narrative>
  </description>
